OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser who stopped woman going to
OL,4,Afather's funeral appeals sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who "terrorised" four women
OL,7,Fduring a long campaign of sexual and
OL,8,Fphysical abuse is appealing his 16-year
OL,9,Fjail sentence, BBC Scotland News has
OL,10,Flearned.
OL,12,FChristopher Malcolm, 37, raped,
OL,13,Fattacked and abused his victims -
OL,14,Fincluding preventing one from attending
OL,15,Fher father's funeral - at locations in
OL,16,FMoray and Lothian.
OL,18,FMalcolm was convicted after a trial and
OL,19,Fjailed at the High Court in Edinburgh
OL,20,Flast month.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
